<title>USA: Medco Research product registered in Europe.</title>
<headline>Medco Research product registered in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medco Research Inc said on Thursday its Adenoscan pharmacologic cardiac stressor has been successfully registered in the European Community and now awaits final licensing approval from the individual member nations.</p>
<p>The product, which increases blood flow to the heart in patients unable to exercise, already is marketed in the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>Adenoscan is made and marketed in the United States and Canada by Medco's commercial partner, Fujiwara USA.</p>
<p>	   ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
